=== PARITY ===
Web source : web/src/features/driving/components/drive-detail/HeroGauges.tsx (presentational; props: DriveDetail + DriveStats).
Native     : apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/HeroGauges/Driving/HeroGauges.{Model,Source,ViewModel}.cs + HeroGauges.cs
Data       : GET /drives/{driveID} via shared CacheThenNetworkEngine -> IHeroGaugesSource (P1/S8); projected to DriveGauges
             (the canonical SI inputs the web component reads off drive + the three DriveStats values it consumes:
             maxSpd, consumptionWhKm, efficiencyPctPer100, per useDriveDetailData.ts) -- no HTTP in the view.
Hooks bound: useTranslation -> ILocalizer ; useSettings + useUnits -> UnitPref applied at the display boundary
             (web converts with convertDistanceFromSI / convertSpeedFromSI; native uses UnitConverters with the same factors).
Radial gauges (web order, RadialGauge parity); the efficiency gauge renders only when both battery endpoints exist:
  [x] Distance    value=round(distanceFromSI)            max=max(value*1.5,100)  unit=km|mi    accent=cyan   (#00f0ff -> ChartRole.Regen)
  [x] Max Speed   value=round(speedFromSI(maxSpeedMps))  max=speedFromSI(250)    unit=km/h|mph accent=purple (#a855f7 -> ChartRole.Power)
  [x] Duration    value=round(durationS/60)              max=max(value*1.5,60)   unit=min      accent=amber  (#f59e0b -> ChartRole.Energy)
  [x] Consumption value=round(consumption*[mi?1.609344]) max=max(value*1.5,300)  unit=Wh/km|Wh/mi accent=red (#ef4444 -> ChartRole.Temperature)
  [x] Efficiency  value=round(pctPer100,2)               max=30                  unit=%/100km|%/100mi accent=green (#10b981 -> ChartRole.Battery)
Derivation : consumptionWhKm = (energyUsedWh ?? |avgPowerKw|*hours*1000) / (distanceM/1000), avgPowerKw =
             avg_power_w/1000 ?? telemetry-mean power (kW); efficiencyPctPer100 = (startBatteryPct-endBatteryPct)/displayDistance*10.
i18n keys (P1/S10 catalog -- all five web t() keys present in Strings/en/Resources.resw, asserted by RecordingLocalizer):
  driveDetail.distance / .maxSpeed / .duration / .consumption / .efficiency (+ surface keys driveDetail.gauges.aria/.empty).
States     : loading(gauge skeletons) / loaded / empty(friendly EmptyState) / error(retry) / stale(chip) / offline(chip)
             -- every branch renders; no hidden surface.
A11y       : surface name + per-gauge AutomationName + refresh/retry Narrator names + group AutomationPeer +
